# mixer.svc's authority (CAP-002): real-time CPU for one audio period
# (1.5 ms of every 5 ms, docs/scheduler.md "Soft real time"), its role
# registration, the HDA driver's endpoint ("hda", absent without audio
# hardware) and its endpoint to devmgr.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.mixer"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (scheduling "scheduling" 1500 5000)
    (notification "mixer" Notify_Access.Manage "registration")
    (service "launcher-peer" "hda")
    (service "device-manager" "ready")]
  optional => ["hda"])
